  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wishful-recipes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/4xVp9RM1/wishcraft(2).png\" alt=\"這個mod已成為願望配方的一部分。請點擊此處查看。它可以動態生成自己的配方，意味著它與其它mod具有高度兼容性且需要較少的配置。\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NUjMWxj.png\" alt=\"Title\"></p>\n<h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/2CUh6gMuCt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1027252425960198165?color=5b6ee1&label=Discord&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/MarsThePlanet\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=MarsThePlanet&type=patrons&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"在Patreon上支持我\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blasting-raw-metal-blocks-into-blocks-fabric-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/886474?color=F16436&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white&label=CurseForge&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fblasting-raw-metal-blocks-into-blocks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/blasting-raw-metal-blocks-into-blocks?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white&label=Modrinth&color=00AF5C\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> </strong></h5>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">這個完全可配置的mod允許您將整塊原礦金屬熔煉成對應的礦物金屬塊，這使得在挖採回來後快速處理大量原礦變得更加高效。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/addJ4gp.png\" alt=\"\" height=\"270\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hD6mAuc.png\" alt=\"\" height=\"270\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ng4QLHA.png\" alt=\"\" height=\"270\"></p>\n<p><strong>設定說明</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>您可以在遊戲內直接設定此mod，或編輯檔案夾中的 JSON 檔案：<code>config/blastingraw.json</code>。請注意所有修改均需重新啟動 Minecraft 才能生效。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>cooking_time</strong> - 熔爐中原物塊的熔煉所需時間（以Ticks計算）</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>raw_metal_list</strong> - 原始塊、其對應的精煉版以及熔煉時所獲經驗值的列表</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>works_in_furnace</strong> - 是否應在高倍烹飪時間內生成常規熔爐中使用原塊的配方</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xa9IJlI.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JNZ2GMV.png\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deimos-fabric-forge-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/83sD0W8.png\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdeimos\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/j2GIPnt.png\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/marstheplanet\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rJIRiP5.png\"></a></p>",
